  "description": "The Shuffle Builder helps you to create schema definition files.\n\n\t\t\tInstalling this tool, will also include the other tools for the Shuffle:\n\t\t\tShuffle Runner and Shuffle Deployer.\n\n\t\t\tRead more: https://jonasr.app/shuffle",
