  "published": "2026-10-09T15:25:12.86Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Changes since 1.2023.5:\n\n- New Batch size field on the Import node (default 1, no batching; max 1000).\n- New Defer state and owner checkbox on the Import node, with a tooltip explaining when it helps.\n- New Bypass sync logic, Bypass async logic and Bypass flows checkboxes on the ShuffleDefinition node.\n- Definitions follow the updated schema: BatchSize and DeferStateAndOwner on Import; BypassSyncLogic, BypassAsyncLogic and BypassFlows on ShuffleDefinition.\n- .NET Framework 4.8; ILMerge removed; DotNetZip replaced with System.IO.Compression.\n\nThe import engine changes are listed in the Shuffle Runner release notes.\nFull details: https://github.com/rappen/Xrm.Shuffle#whats-new-since-120235",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Build schema files for the Shuffle. Empower yourself to achieve more.",
